<title>ITALY: Italian cabinet to discuss welfare state Thursday.</title>
<headline>Italian cabinet to discuss welfare state Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Italian cabinet meeting to be held at 1330 GMT on Thursday will discuss the country's welfare state, a statement from Prime Minister Romano Prodi's office said.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details but put the welfare state at the top of the agenda of issues to be examined. -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
